WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.417
This paper studies two workhorse optimizers,
momentum SGD and AdaGrad.

00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:09.815
Despite practical success, their non-convex theory lags.

00:00:09.895 --> 00:00:15.076
The authors prove both converge almost surely to
stationary points,

00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:18.060
and show why momentum accelerates SGD.
